<title>CANADA: Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 4.033 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank of Canada 91-day T-bill yields avg 4.033 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said the average yield at this week's auction of C$3.6 billion of 91-day Government of Canada treasury bills due November 28, 1996 was 4.033 percent, unchanged from last week.</p>
<p>The average yield on C$1.8 billion of 182-day T-bills due February 27, 1997 was 4.319 percent, up from 4.288 percent last week, and on C$1.2 billion of 357-day T-bills due August 21, 1997 was 4.755 percent, up from 4.537 percent.</p>
<p>The Bank bought C$1.05 billion three-month, C$100 million six-month and C$100 million one-year bills. It holds C$1.4 billion of C$8.2 billion of bills due Sept. 5.</p>
